# Web Frontend Conventions

## Data fetching

**TanStack Query** for server state via `orpc` utils:

```tsx
import { useQuery } from "@tanstack/react-query";
import { orpc } from "@/lib/orpc";

const { data } = useQuery(
  orpc.agencyOps.clients.list.queryOptions({ input: { teamId } }),
);
```

**Zustand** only for UI state and optimistic orchestration — use `orpcClient` + cache helpers in `lib/utils/agency-query-cache.ts`.

## Styling

- `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for all class merging
- `cva()` only inside `components/ui/*` (shadcn primitives)
- Semantic tokens: `text-muted`, `bg-background`, `text-primary` — never raw gray classes
- Follow [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md): flat UI, hairline borders, no gradients/glassmorphism

## Forms

```tsx
import { useForm } from "react-hook-form";
import { zodResolver } from "@hookform/resolvers/zod";
import { loginSchema } from "@/lib/schemas/auth";
```

Schemas live in `apps/web/src/lib/schemas/`. Use shadcn `Form*` components.

## Routing

- Pages in `src/pages/`, lazy-loaded in `app.tsx`
- Protected routes in `authenticated-routes.tsx` behind `ProtectedRoute`
- App-local imports use `@/` alias

## Folder structure

```
src/
  pages/          # route pages
  components/     # UI by domain (agency/, dashboard/, ui/)
  lib/            # orpc client, hooks, utils, schemas/
  stores/         # Zustand stores
  providers/      # React context
```
